{"skill":{"slug":"neural-memory","displayName":"neural-memory"},"version":{"version":"4.62.0","createdAt":1786881925677,"changelog":"- Removed the file skill-card.md.\n- No changes to functionality or user-facing features.\n- Documentation and setup instructions in SKILL.md remain unchanged.","changelogSource":"auto","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":9700,"sha256":"e8904fba0f54e655a5f678bedc1270fce244f327c43153a3f1a2122fb5756e0d","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1968,"sha256":"492752f1c60464f609ed70d4560e410302d3e8bdd4f704e52277ebf8396e3b90","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789054784467,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"f75cafdb43938f8cea6833ab4feb1ac3c5d0b6971a09c22ab3f716860435c410","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/f75cafdb43938f8cea6833ab4feb1ac3c5d0b6971a09c22ab3f716860435c410","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"stale","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"pending","analysis":null,"source":null,"checkedAt":1786882006839},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":49,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":5,"checkedAt":1789054784467},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"This memory skill is purpose-aligned, but it enables broad automatic capture and reinjection of conversation data with limited consent and safety controls.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill persists conversation-derived facts, decisions, preferences, TODOs, errors, and instruction-type records locally, which is sensitive but only partially scoped by brain name and configuration.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"Installation relies on unpinned registry packages and a global npm install followed by npm run build; the metadata also labels a pip install as kind node, creating ambiguity about the authoritative package path.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The skill directs proactive use at session start, during conversations, and at session end, and the sample plugin config enables autoContext and autoCapture by default without a review or approval step.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"It uses cross-session hooks to inject memories before runs and extract memories after runs, with no explicit sensitive-data exclusions, TTLs beyond quick TODOs, or clear delete/review controls in the artifact.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The persistent associative-memory behavior fits the stated purpose, including recall, TODOs, versioning, and cross-session context.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Review this carefully before installing. Use a dedicated brain per project, disable autoCapture and autoContext unless you explicitly want cross-session memory, avoid using it in conversations containing secrets or regulated data, and verify the exact pip/npm packages and versions before running the install or build commands.","findings":"[SQP-2] unexpected: The artifact supports the concern: default auto-context and auto-capture are shown in the recommended plugin configuration without prominent consent or retention controls.\n[SQP-1] expected: Proactive recall is central to a memory skill, but the trigger surface is broad enough to raise a review concern because it includes new tasks and routine decision/error capture.\n[SSD-3] expected: Persistent memory storage and reuse are expected for this skill, but the artifact lacks clear guardrails for secrets, private data, or instruction-like memories.\n[T08] unexpected: The unpinned pip and npm installation path is not required by the memory function itself and increases supply-chain ambiguity.\n[other] expected: Automatic persistent capture and reinjection are disclosed and purpose-related, but the lack of user review and sensitivity controls makes the risk material rather than merely informational.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789054784467}}}}}